{"lyrics":"[00:00.32]I don't know if it's because my heart hurts or if I'm insecure (Insecure)\n[00:12.16]I'm not sure (I'm not sure)\n[00:12.98](Yeah, I like that)\n[00:13.46]Uh\n[00:13.52]Yeah, I'm not sure (I'm not sure)\n[00:14.30]I don't know if it's because my heart hurts or if I'm insecure (Insecure)\n[00:17.98]Baby, you're not her (Not her)\n[00:20.08]My last girl had me so fucked up, it was a blacked out blur (Blacked out blur)\n[00:24.24]Baby, you jump first (Jump first)\n[00:26.62]It's a long way to Hell, I ain't really tryna leave this Earth (Leave this Earth)\n[00:30.30]Baby, do your worst (Worst)\n[00:31.96]I've come to the conclusion you can't kill me if I kill you first (If I kill you first)\n[00:37.26]I've been through the wringer (Wringer)\n[00:39.36]Tryna put a diamond ring on her finger (Finger)\n[00:42.42]She love drama, she be watching Jerry Springer (Jerry Springer)\n[00:45.52]Next thing you know, we all on Jerry Springer (Jerry Springer)\n[00:48.68]I play love games, but no, I'm not a cheater (Cheater)\n[00:51.00]She hate it when I sip codeine, I'm a leaner (Leaner)\n[00:54.08]The devil on my shoulder keep on telling me to keep her (Her)\n[00:57.34]Should I take her out or should I take her to the cleaner? (Cleaner)\n[01:01.14]Love don't end good for me, no good for me\n[01:04.96]She's good for me, too good\n[01:07.34]These hoes love playing me, heartbreaking me\n[01:11.10]Don't pray for me, just give me drugs (Bring me drugs)\n[01:15.72]Just give me drugs\n[01:18.98]Just bring me drugs\n[01:19.80]Just give me drugs\n[01:20.70]Yeah, I'm not sure (I'm not sure)\n[01:27.68]I don't know if it's because my heart hurts or if I'm insecure (Insecure)\n[01:31.38]Baby, you're not her (Not her)\n[01:33.46]My last girl had me so fucked up, it was a blacked out blur (Blacked out blur)\n[01:37.54]Baby, you jump first (Jump first)\n[01:40.00]It's a long way to Hell, I ain't really tryna leave this Earth (Leave this Earth)\n[01:43.80]Baby, do your worst (Worst)\n[01:45.78]I've come to the conclusion you can't kill me if I kill you first (If I kill you first)\n[01:49.78]I told her, \"Run around and get away\", I think I need a getaway\n[01:53.06]I need to call a timeout, I need to set another play\n[01:56.12]I need a umbrella 'cause every day feel like a rainy day\n[01:59.40]I need something other than Xannies to take the pain away\n[02:02.40]I ran away to California, I'm tryna cut corners\n[02:05.18]Satan bossin' me around, but you know I don't take orders\n[02:08.10]Yeah, I had to move around, I was startin' to feel cornered\n[02:11.44]Startin' to feel cornered, I can't see the front door\n[02:14.48]Startin' to feel cornered, startin' to feel slaughtered\n[02:17.56]Started to not give a fuck, screamin' out, \"Why bother?\"\n[02:20.52]My ex-bitch too bad, my next bitch way hotter\n[02:23.56]We met in a car crash, she ride it like full throttle\n[02:26.98]I'm not sure (I'm not sure)\n[02:28.82]I don't know if it's because my heart hurts or if I'm insecure (Insecure)\n[02:32.52]Baby, you're not her (Not her)\n[02:34.60]My last girl had me so fucked up, it was a blacked out blur (Blacked out blur)\n[02:38.68]Baby, you jump first (Jump first)\n[02:41.14]It's a long way to Hell, I ain't really tryna leave this Earth (Leave this Earth)\n[02:44.94]Baby, do your worst (Worst)\n[02:46.88]I've come to the conclusion you can't kill me if I kill you first (If I kill you first)","words":[[0.32,0.32,"I"],[1.1,1.7,"don't"],[2.06,2.5,"know"],[2.64,2.72,"if"],[2.78,2.86,"it's"],[2.94,3.26,"because"],[3.3,3.42,"my"],[3.52,3.84,"heart"],[3.88,4.06,"hurts"],[4.12,4.24,"or"],[4.28,4.4,"if"],[6.36,6.44,"I'm"],[6.48,8.6,"insecure"],[11.4,12.08,"(Insecure)"],[12.16,12.2,"I'm"],[12.24,12.3,"not"],[12.34,12.4,"sure"],[12.44,12.52,"(I'm"],[12.6,12.78,"not"],[12.82,12.88,"sure)"],[12.98,13.1,"(Yeah,"],[13.14,13.14,"I"],[13.22,13.28,"like"],[13.32,13.38,"that)"],[13.46,13.48,"Uh"],[13.52,13.58,"Yeah,"],[13.62,13.66,"I'm"],[13.7,13.74,"not"],[13.7